{"title":"Kobold Chief","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 16 Kobold that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief?lv=16\">Lv 16</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief?lv=15\" title=\"Pick level 15\"><td><b>15</b></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief?lv=16\" title=\"Pick level 16\"><td><b>16</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 3 recorded drops, 212 total, 58–83 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×58–83</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 2 of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 8 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-head\" title=\"Bearhide Head - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b31cec1ed7b01d27c08d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"frostvein-rune-seal\" title=\"Frostvein Rune Seal - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8f6f167c1af9b0435aa2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Frostvein Rune Seal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-dagger\" title=\"Silver Dagger - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/gutterclaw\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/fd4e9da75faaca2c314d.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Gutterclaw</b><span>Lv 15</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/old-wickjaw\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2a4c38ef4916af1ed50a.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Old Wickjaw</b><span>Lv 18</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Kobold: <a href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger\">Kobold Digger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper\">Kobold Trapper</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/kobold-shaman\">Kobold Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/f2aedaa7cf14a7182fe3.svg\" alt=\"Kobold Chief\"></div><h3>Kobold Chief</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>18</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 16)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Kobold</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>57</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>14.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>900</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}